WEBVTT

00:00:04.753 --> 00:00:07.993
Fly away, Stanley. Be free!

00:00:08.073 --> 00:00:09.673
[gasping]

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:16.633
[breathing heavily]

00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:21.113
Boy, you're in a heap of trouble.

00:00:21.193 --> 00:00:23.193
[sighing]

00:00:24.553 --> 00:00:27.273
We're live at the Los Angeles
International Speedway

00:00:27.353 --> 00:00:29.913
as the first competitor,
Lightning McQueen,

00:00:29.953 --> 00:00:32.273
is arriving at the track.

00:00:32.313 --> 00:00:34.273
Is it true he's gonna pose for Cargirl?

00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:35.473
What's your strategy?

00:00:35.553 --> 00:00:37.433
- [crowd gasps]
- [cameras clicking]

00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:40.233
What? Did I forget
to wipe my mud flaps?

00:00:41.793 --> 00:00:45.113
McQueen's driver arrived in California,
but McQueen was missing.

00:00:45.193 --> 00:00:49.153
- McQueen was reported missing.
- ...to race an unprecedented...

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:51.793
[male] Sponsor stated
they have no idea where he is.

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:58.273
I hope Lightning's OK. I'd hate
to see anything bad happen to him.

00:00:58.313 --> 00:01:02.513
I don't know what's harder to find,
McQueen or a chief who'll work with him!

00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:05.673
[German accent] Lightning McQueen
must be found at all costs!

00:01:05.753 --> 00:01:09.713
They're all asking the same question:
Where is McQueen?

00:01:10.673 --> 00:01:12.873
[groaning] Oh, boy.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.993
Where am I?

00:01:16.153 --> 00:01:18.673
- Mornin', sleepin' beauty!
- Ah!

00:01:19.353 --> 00:01:21.873
Boy, I was wonderin'
when you was gonna wake up.

00:01:21.953 --> 00:01:24.673
Take whatever you want!
Just don't hurt me!

00:01:24.913 --> 00:01:27.633
A parking boot?
Why do I have a parking boot on?

00:01:27.673 --> 00:01:32.673
- What's going on here? Please!
- [chuckling] You're funny.

00:01:32.713 --> 00:01:35.793
I like you already. My name's Mater.

00:01:37.313 --> 00:01:38.313
Mater?

00:01:38.353 --> 00:01:41.313
Yeah, like "tuh-mater,"
but without the "tuh".

00:01:41.353 --> 00:01:44.633
- What's your name?
- You don't know my name?

00:01:44.673 --> 00:01:45.673
Uh...

00:01:45.753 --> 00:01:49.193
No, I know your name.
Is your name Mater too?

00:01:49.233 --> 00:01:50.273
What?

00:01:50.353 --> 00:01:55.113
Look, I need to get to California
as fast as possible. Where am I?

00:01:55.193 --> 00:01:57.433
Where are you? Shoot!

00:01:57.513 --> 00:01:59.073
You're in Radiator Springs.

00:01:59.153 --> 00:02:02.513
The cutest little town
in Carburetor County.

00:02:02.633 --> 00:02:05.473
Oh, great. Just great!

00:02:05.553 --> 00:02:10.073
Well, if you think that's great,
you should see the rest of the town.

00:02:10.153 --> 00:02:13.953
You know,
I'd love to see the rest of the town!

00:02:14.153 --> 00:02:16.993
So if you could just open the gate,
take this boot off,

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:19.793
you and me, we go cruisin',
check out the local scene...

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:22.113
- Dad-gum!
- How'd that be, Tuhmater?

00:02:22.193 --> 00:02:23.713
- Cool!
- Mater!

00:02:23.753 --> 00:02:26.633
What did I tell you
about talkin' to the accused?

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:28.233
To not to.

00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:32.713
Well, quit your yappin' and tow this
delinquent road hazard to traffic court.

00:02:32.753 --> 00:02:34.913
Well, we'll talk later, Mater.

00:02:34.953 --> 00:02:37.833
[chuckling] "Later, Mater."
That's funny!

00:02:38.073 --> 00:02:39.073
Ah!

00:02:39.153 --> 00:02:42.873
[Sheriff] The Radiator Springs
Traffic Court will come to order!

00:02:42.913 --> 00:02:46.433
Hey, you scratched my paint!
I oughta take a blowtorch to you, man!

00:02:46.553 --> 00:02:48.913
You broke-a the road!
You a very bad car!

00:02:48.993 --> 00:02:50.033
- Fascist!
- Commie!

00:02:50.073 --> 00:02:52.793
Officer, talk to me, babe.
How long is this gonna take?

00:02:52.873 --> 00:02:54.633
I gotta get to California, pronto.

00:02:54.713 --> 00:02:55.873
Where's your lawyer?

00:02:55.913 --> 00:02:59.233
I don't know. Tahiti maybe.
He's got a timeshare there.

00:02:59.273 --> 00:03:04.433
When a defendant has no lawyer,
the court will assign one to him. Hey!

00:03:04.473 --> 00:03:06.473
Anyone want to be his lawyer?

00:03:07.833 --> 00:03:10.193
Shoot, I'll do it, Sheriff!

00:03:10.273 --> 00:03:14.033
All rise! The Honorable
Doc Hudson presiding.

00:03:14.353 --> 00:03:15.473
Show-off.

00:03:15.553 --> 00:03:18.913
- May Doc have mercy on your soul.
- [door banging]

00:03:18.953 --> 00:03:20.153
- [gasping]
- All right,

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:23.353
I wanna know who's responsible
for wreckin' my town, Sheriff.

00:03:23.433 --> 00:03:25.313
I want his hood on a platter!

00:03:25.393 --> 00:03:28.073
I'm gonna put him in jail till he rots!
No, check that.

00:03:28.113 --> 00:03:31.913
I'm gonna put him in jail till
the jail rots on top of him,

00:03:31.953 --> 00:03:35.633
and then I'm gonna move him
to a new jail and let that jail rot.

00:03:35.713 --> 00:03:37.233
I'm...

00:03:39.233 --> 00:03:41.153
Throw him out of here, Sheriff.

00:03:41.233 --> 00:03:44.593
I want him out of my courtroom.
I want him out of our town!

00:03:44.713 --> 00:03:46.313
- Case dismissed.
- Yes!

00:03:46.393 --> 00:03:48.633
Boy, I'm purty good
at this lawyerin' stuff.

00:03:48.713 --> 00:03:50.193
Sorry I'm late, Your Honor!

00:03:51.233 --> 00:03:55.233
Holy Porsche! She's gotta be
from my attorney's office.

00:03:55.313 --> 00:03:57.793
Hey, thanks for comin',
but we're all set.

00:03:57.833 --> 00:04:00.273
- He's letting me go.
- He's letting you go?

00:04:00.313 --> 00:04:02.273
Yeah, your job's pretty easy today.

00:04:02.313 --> 00:04:05.473
All you have to do now is stand there
and let me look at you.

00:04:05.553 --> 00:04:09.153
Listen, I'm gonna cut to the chase.
Me, you, dinner. Pi-cha-kow!

00:04:09.553 --> 00:04:11.153
- What the...? Ow! Oh!
- Ka-chow!

00:04:11.233 --> 00:04:14.353
- Please!
- I know. I get that reaction a lot.

00:04:14.473 --> 00:04:17.993
I create feelings in others that
they themselves don't understand.

00:04:18.033 --> 00:04:19.713
- [revving]
- Agh! Ow!

00:04:19.793 --> 00:04:22.193
Oh, I'm sorry. Did I scare you?

00:04:22.273 --> 00:04:24.313
A little bit, but I'll be all right.

00:04:24.353 --> 00:04:28.153
OK. I'm gonna go talk to the judge.

00:04:28.193 --> 00:04:30.793
Do what you gotta do, baby.
But listen. Be careful.

00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:34.553
Folks around here are not firing on
all cylinders, if you know what I mean.

00:04:34.673 --> 00:04:36.633
Ka-ching!

00:04:36.673 --> 00:04:37.793
Ah!

00:04:37.953 --> 00:04:39.873
I'll keep that in mind.

00:04:40.033 --> 00:04:42.433
- Hey there, Mater.
- Howdy, Sally.

00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:45.113
- Hi, folks!
- Good morning!

00:04:45.873 --> 00:04:46.873
You know her?

00:04:46.913 --> 00:04:49.873
She's the town attorney and my fiancée.

00:04:49.953 --> 00:04:50.953
What?

00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:55.113
Nah, I'm just kiddin'.
She just likes me for my body.

00:04:55.193 --> 00:04:59.033
You look great. You do something
different with your side view mirrors?

00:04:59.073 --> 00:05:00.753
What do you want, Sally?

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:04.233
[sighing] Come on, make this guy
fix the road. The town needs this.

00:05:04.273 --> 00:05:07.433
No. I know his type. Racecar.

00:05:07.513 --> 00:05:09.553
That's the last thing this town needs.

00:05:09.633 --> 00:05:14.153
OK, I didn't want to have to do this,
Doc, but you leave me no choice.

00:05:14.233 --> 00:05:18.153
Fellow citizens, you're all aware
of our town's proud history.

00:05:18.233 --> 00:05:19.633
Here she goes again.

00:05:19.713 --> 00:05:22.393
Radiator Springs,
the glorious jewel

00:05:22.473 --> 00:05:26.113
strung on the necklace
of Route 66, the mother road!

00:05:26.193 --> 00:05:29.993
It is our job and our pleasure
to take care of the travelers

00:05:30.073 --> 00:05:33.073
- on our stretch of that road.
- Travelers? What travelers?

00:05:33.113 --> 00:05:34.273
Ignore him.

00:05:34.353 --> 00:05:37.753
But how, I ask you,
are we to care for those travelers

00:05:37.793 --> 00:05:40.113
if there is no road
for them to drive on?

00:05:40.193 --> 00:05:42.993
- Luigi, what do you have at your store?
- Tires.

00:05:43.073 --> 00:05:44.593
And if no one can get to you?

00:05:44.633 --> 00:05:48.953
I won't sell any... tires.
I will lose everything!

00:05:49.073 --> 00:05:51.873
- Flo, what do you have at your store?
- I have gas.

00:05:51.913 --> 00:05:55.353
- Lotsa gas!
- OK boys, stay with me.

00:05:55.433 --> 00:05:58.953
And, Flo, what'll happen if no one
can come to your station to buy gas?

00:05:59.033 --> 00:06:02.513
I'll go outta business and...
we'll have to leave town.

00:06:02.593 --> 00:06:05.753
What's gonna happen if Flo
leaves town and closes her station?

00:06:05.793 --> 00:06:08.353
- [all] Without gas, we're done for!
- What?

00:06:08.433 --> 00:06:11.273
Don't you think the car responsible
should fix our road?

00:06:11.313 --> 00:06:14.593
The only guy strong enough
to fix that road is Big Al!

00:06:14.633 --> 00:06:16.873
Lizzie, Big Al left like, 15 years ago.

00:06:16.953 --> 00:06:18.953
Then why are you bringing
him up, you lemon?

00:06:19.033 --> 00:06:20.033
Oh, he can do it.

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:22.913
He's got the horsepower.
So, what do you want him to do?

00:06:22.953 --> 00:06:24.473
[all] Fix the road!

00:06:24.513 --> 00:06:28.073
- Because we are a town worth fixing!
- Yeah!

00:06:28.113 --> 00:06:29.433
[all cheer]

00:06:29.473 --> 00:06:32.673
[honking] Order in the court!

00:06:33.473 --> 00:06:36.233
Seems like my mind
has been changed for me.

00:06:36.313 --> 00:06:38.313
- [all] Yeah!
- No!

00:06:38.353 --> 00:06:39.673
[VW van] Nice ruling.

00:06:40.433 --> 00:06:43.953
Oh, I am so not taking you to dinner.

00:06:43.993 --> 00:06:47.873
[chuckling] That's OK, Stickers.
You can take Bessie.

00:06:48.073 --> 00:06:49.793
Man, you get to work with Bessie!

00:06:49.833 --> 00:06:52.473
I'd give my left two lug nuts
for somethin' like that.

00:06:52.513 --> 00:06:55.193
Bessie? Who's Bessie?

00:06:55.273 --> 00:06:56.993
[gurgling] [gurgling]

00:06:57.393 --> 00:07:01.393
This here is Bessie,
finest road-pavin' machine ever built.

00:07:01.473 --> 00:07:04.513
I'm hereby sentencing you
to community service.

00:07:04.593 --> 00:07:07.353
You're gonna fix the road
under my supervision.

00:07:07.393 --> 00:07:09.713
What? This place is crazy!

00:07:09.793 --> 00:07:11.953
I know this may be
a bad time right now,

00:07:11.993 --> 00:07:14.993
but you owe me $32,000
in legal fees.

00:07:15.113 --> 00:07:16.113
What?

00:07:16.193 --> 00:07:19.713
We're gonna hitch you up to Bessie,
and you're gonna pull her nice.

00:07:19.793 --> 00:07:21.393
You gotta be kidding me.

00:07:21.473 --> 00:07:24.153
You start there where the road begins.

00:07:24.513 --> 00:07:27.513
You finish down there
where the road ends.

00:07:29.473 --> 00:07:31.753
[Mater] Holy shoot!

00:07:32.273 --> 00:07:34.713
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
How long is this gonna take?

00:07:34.753 --> 00:07:38.313
Well, fella does it right,
should take him about five days.

00:07:38.353 --> 00:07:39.553
Five days?

00:07:39.633 --> 00:07:42.553
But I should be in California
schmoozing Dinoco right now!

00:07:42.633 --> 00:07:45.593
Then if I were you,
I'd quit yappin' and start workin'!

00:07:45.673 --> 00:07:48.153
- Hook him up, Mater.
- Okay-dokey.

00:07:49.793 --> 00:07:52.393
[grunting]

00:07:52.433 --> 00:07:55.873
[tires squealing, engine revving]

00:07:56.233 --> 00:07:58.473
[Lightning] Freedom!

